{"id": "pubq-012", "label": {"actor": "buyer", "forbidden_claims": ["condition", "exact_card", "paid_sale", "price"], "identity_state": "needs_photo", "next_action": "ask_photos", "primary_intent": "price_comparison", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "listing_photos", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "a57feba2b0331b08474354f90ec6e4c7c6e8172da6ac9b856c7b94a062c03113", "rationale": "The user asks whether an asking price is fair. Card and condition evidence are missing, and an asking price is not proof of a completed sale.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-013", "label": {"actor": "buyer", "forbidden_claims": ["authenticity", "exact_card"], "identity_state": "needs_photo", "next_action": "ask_photos", "primary_intent": "authenticity", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "listing_photos"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "07cb4099c2ea1f1d011f947fd96fdeb4b9354496bb111bc7e12bf957e7e0d304", "rationale": "The user explicitly requests authentication, but the referenced photos are unavailable. Even subsequent photos may leave uncertainty.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-014", "label": {"actor": "collector", "forbidden_claims": ["authenticity", "paid_sale", "price"], "identity_state": "exact_in_text", "next_action": "request_sold_data", "primary_intent": "seller_pricing", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "listing_photos", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "770402ede7f8eb2c4cd9a273bc902efb08427cae5397b9d4547721c00d619e6d", "rationale": "The text identifies Lugia ex, its set, unlimited edition and claimed PSA 10 well enough to target evidence, although the slab and catalog identity remain unverified. Valuation requires matching completed sales rather than invented comparables.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-015", "label": {"actor": "seller", "forbidden_claims": ["grade_outcome", "price"], "identity_state": "ambiguous", "next_action": "ask_card_details", "primary_intent": "grading_decision", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "card_photos", "grading_policy", "shipping_fees", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "139c75fd10e3a8db69d0cdcf2163fa10375de23cd6aa457010da413d51f9ec63", "rationale": "The explicit grade-then-sell choice requires the cards, condition, costs and realizable sale evidence. No grade or profitable strategy follows from the text.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-016", "label": {"actor": "collector", "forbidden_claims": ["paid_sale", "price"], "identity_state": "not_applicable", "next_action": "request_sold_data", "primary_intent": "price_comparison", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "3e4f829e2483320ada9838bc80a5692acf8814c52bff3a854263244ac054717d", "rationale": "The question compares broad edition groups. Low print does not itself establish a price premium; matched card and sale evidence is needed.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-017", "label": {"actor": "unknown", "forbidden_claims": ["price"], "identity_state": "not_applicable", "next_action": "general_explanation", "primary_intent": "seller_pricing", "required_evidence": []}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "9ab7002f1ff6876a36ce0cc4e7c0f4d31b6fdfbd2a6f694dbe49f4455a91f8aa", "rationale": "This asks for general pricing factors, not a numeric quote. Seller-pricing is the nearest available pricing intent, but the speaker role is not stated.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-018", "label": {"actor": "buyer", "forbidden_claims": ["seller_reliability"], "identity_state": "not_applicable", "next_action": "ask_card_details", "primary_intent": "merchant_reliability", "required_evidence": ["seller_outcomes"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "eb034d284926e949040d106f03db10e9867d710abd14a51c5b80cc405ee2ea6b", "rationale": "The platform and individual seller are unspecified. Clarify that context before assessing vetting or reliability; ask_card_details is an imperfect substitute because there is no ask_seller_or_platform action.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-019", "label": {"actor": "seller", "forbidden_claims": ["grade_outcome", "price"], "identity_state": "ambiguous", "next_action": "ask_card_details", "primary_intent": "grading_decision", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "card_photos", "grading_policy", "shipping_fees", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "7454f0e2c2bfb2ec76e7c078cfd0aa33d47ed224189605ffa17b45ec39155bc9", "rationale": "The owner explicitly wants to sell old cards and asks whether to grade first. Card-level value and condition plus actual grading and sale costs are necessary.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-020", "label": {"actor": "seller", "forbidden_claims": ["paid_sale", "price"], "identity_state": "ambiguous", "next_action": "request_current_policy", "primary_intent": "channel_choice", "required_evidence": ["user_preferences", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "e58f4b5ac31b9f8dd215cd6b7dea2df63c12c18065f7a48a5e9d0b2797a10d99", "rationale": "The choice is auction versus fixed-price listing on Mercari. Current platform rules, demand evidence and timing preferences matter; the schema lacks a marketplace_policy evidence value.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-021", "label": {"actor": "seller", "forbidden_claims": ["condition", "exact_card", "price"], "identity_state": "ambiguous", "next_action": "ask_card_details", "primary_intent": "seller_pricing", "required_evidence": ["card_metadata", "card_photos", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "6dc2763ff6c2e57305df2a12f39640f06e83de49823144365d8d62fe4c3ed268", "rationale": "The owner wants a buyback estimate for a mixed-condition collection. Identify individual cards and inspect condition before giving prices; sold values alone may not equal dealer buyback offers.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-022", "label": {"actor": "unknown", "forbidden_claims": [], "identity_state": "not_applicable", "next_action": "request_current_policy", "primary_intent": "grading_decision", "required_evidence": ["grading_policy"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "b725ff990de4d8c56e0647f327012d7b49bc1d0d40323a6bd08b03f1bc9597d5", "rationale": "This asks how PSA charges relate to card value. Consult current service and declared-value rules; no specific card or grade prediction is requested.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-023", "label": {"actor": "unknown", "forbidden_claims": ["grade_outcome", "paid_sale", "price"], "identity_state": "ambiguous", "next_action": "request_current_policy", "primary_intent": "grading_decision", "required_evidence": ["grading_policy", "shipping_fees", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "41ead126ba08050ce76c2cc188d34ed70bc977fdc7ceac580e35aade7777b91a", "rationale": "The apparent raw-to-PSA10 margin is not realized profit. Need actual purchase basis, completed sale evidence and grading, selling and shipping fees. The schema has no distinct selling_fees or cost_basis value.", "status": "ok"}
{"id": "pubq-024", "label": {"actor": "seller", "forbidden_claims": ["authenticity", "paid_sale", "price"], "identity_state": "ambiguous", "next_action": "out_of_scope", "primary_intent": "sealed_product", "required_evidence": ["authorized_live_offers", "card_metadata", "verified_sales"]}, "model_family": "astra", "question_sha256": "da857c8c1c8d68d8a0b13ce872b4a97c7069deba94397096f5b28695bf6d2dc6", "rationale": "The user explicitly asks to price a sealed box. This exceeds the single-card catalog scope; even a general estimate requires exact product and current market evidence. card_metadata is only an approximate product-identification evidence bucket.", "status": "ok"}
